    "refresh_cadence_days": 30,
    "note": "SCAFFOLD -- illustrative, NOT exhaustive. New IP appears constantly and a list written today is measurably worse in four months. Add trending IP on the refresh cadence; treat last_reviewed as a staleness alarm, not decoration.",
    "what_this_is": "A keyword screen. It finds terms it knows about. It does NOT clear anything -- a clean pass means 'no flags found', never 'safe to publish'. Trademark turns on likelihood of confusion, not string equality, so a near-miss like 'Star Warz' will pass this screen and still infringe.",
    "tiers": {
      "1_hard_block": "No legitimate generic use on apparel. Never reaches the human review queue.",
      "2_co_occurrence": "Ordinary English words that are also marks. Fires only alongside a companion term, so 'apple pie' passes and 'apple iphone' does not. Routes to human review.",
      "3_patterns": "Regex families that mimic licensed-merchandise conventions. Routes to human review."
    }
  },

